From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luca Martinetti <luca@luca.io>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:51:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Replace the trail line with a model-generated Activity
 line
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Infer a ↳ Activity: explanation alongside ◐ Goal: (two model calls at
start, then at most one pair per 30s), drop the raw tool trail, and
raise the recap limit from 120 to 200 characters.
---
